        "original_id": "914be4be-a645-51a0-aef3-786595f07412",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Robinsons Galleria, Robinsons Galleria Ortigas, SM Megamall, Galleria Corporate Center, Quezon City, Ortigas business district, Metro Manila, Philippines\n- Concepts: mixed-use complex, shopping mall\n\nFacts:\n- Robinsons Galleria, also known as Robinsons Galleria Ortigas, is a mixed-use complex and shopping mall at EDSA corner Ortigas Avenue in Quezon City near SM Megamall.\n- SM Megamall is a shopping mall in the Ortigas business district of Metro Manila, Philippines.\n- SM Megamall comprises two buildings connected by a bridge.\n- SM Megamall occupies about 10 hectares and has a total floor area of 474,000 square meters.\n- SM Megamall is the second largest shopping mall in the Philippines and the fourth largest in the world.\n- Galleria Corporate Center is located beside Robinsons Galleria.",
